t3. erasure oracles compared, on the assembly t2 emitted
    source: asm/t2_aggregate_erasure.s
    bodies with their own code: 5
    symbols aliased by the assembler: 2
      _t2_scalar_typed = _t2_scalar_native
      _t2_typed_sum_warm = _t2_typed_sum_aligned_access3

--- oracle A: symbol identity, which is the panel's instrument ---
    t2_scalar_typed        vs t2_scalar_native       -> ERASED
    t2_typed_sum           vs t2_handwritten_sum     -> reports NOT ERASED

--- oracle B: opcode multiset ---

  t2_scalar_typed vs t2_scalar_native
